# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific permissions, not shared config)
.claude/

# Note: chart/data outputs are NOT ignored here - Product MtM/*.png is
# committed reference output, while Estimators/*.png and per-product
# audit CSVs already have their own folder-level .gitignore. See
# CLAUDE.md "Chart (.png) versioning differs by folder".

# Stray virtualenv created at a literal placeholder path
path/

